1
00:00:00,208 --> 00:00:01,208
Who the hell is it?

2
00:00:01,835 --> 00:00:02,877
Whoa, you scared me.

3
00:00:04,129 --> 00:00:04,756
How did you find

4
00:00:04,757 --> 00:00:05,757
out where I live?

5
00:00:14,139 --> 00:00:15,598
I'm so full, now I'm sleepy.

6
00:00:16,224 --> 00:00:17,517
Go wash up and get some sleep.

7
00:00:18,143 --> 00:00:18,817
Wake me up

8
00:00:18,818 --> 00:00:19,818
in ten minutes, okay?

9
00:00:21,479 --> 00:00:23,106
Why are you sleeping here?

10
00:00:23,523 --> 00:00:25,233
It's warm here.

11
00:00:25,900 --> 00:00:26,900
Hey

12
00:00:27,068 --> 00:00:27,837
why don't you just prepare

13
00:00:27,838 --> 00:00:28,878
for the match at my place?

14
00:00:30,405 --> 00:00:32,031
You're scared, aren't you?

15
00:00:33,241 --> 00:00:34,241
No, I'm not.

16
00:00:36,369 --> 00:00:37,409
It's the selection match

17
00:00:37,410 --> 00:00:38,455
right after training.

18
00:00:38,455 --> 00:00:39,203
And your parents

19
00:00:39,204 --> 00:00:40,204
aren't even here.

20
00:00:40,415 --> 00:00:41,474
Isn't it better than

21
00:00:41,475 --> 00:00:42,475
going back and forth?

22
00:00:43,835 --> 00:00:45,003
As you wish.

23
00:00:46,755 --> 00:00:47,755
Really?
